<title>USA: Alpha Microsystems launches product.</title>
<headline>Alpha Microsystems launches product.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA ANA, Calif 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alpha Microsystems said its Alpha StockVue stock market application will be available in late September for $39.95.</p>
<p>Alpha StockVue, an &quot;off the shelf&quot; end-user application, facilitates easy retrieval of stock and mutual fund quotes, SEC filings, news items and other stock market data, and includes such features as stock-price and trading-volume limit alerts, portfolio valuations and animated ticker tape display.</p>
</text>
